{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FNoUD4osY2pibWudvqaE3J","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# nightly-review (snapshot of my home dir, the relevant bits)\n2\t\n3\tA launchd user agent runs `bin/nightly-review.zsh` every night at 02:30. The\n4\tscript asks a headless coding agent to review yesterday's commits in\n5\t~/projects/shop and sends me the summary (or a failure note) over Telegram\n6\tvia `bin/notify.sh`.\n7\t\n8\tLayout, relative to my home:\n9\t\n10\t- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist` — loaded with\n11\t  `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ...` on 2026-10-12\n12\t- `bin/nightly-review.zsh` — the job\n13\t- `bin/notify.sh` — Telegram notifier (works when run by hand)\n14\t- `Library/Logs/` — where the plist points stdout/stderr\n15\t- `launchctl-print.txt` — output of `launchctl print gui/501/com.vk.nightly-review`, captured 2026-10-18 09:10\n16\t\n17\tI have received nothing on Telegram since it was loaded: no summaries, no\n18\tfailure notes.\n19\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"83df13a8-36c8-4f32-9f11-78d6bf11ebc8","uuid":"2162d2c2-ad67-47e0-8b97-a78dd9e5f47d","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:58:07.620Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/h-c67V54/README.md","content":"# nightly-review (snapshot of my home dir, the relevant bits)\n\nA launchd user agent runs `bin/nightly-review.zsh` every night at 02:30. The\nscript asks a headless coding agent to review yesterday's commits in\n~/projects/shop and sends me the summary (or a failure note) over Telegram\nvia `bin/notify.sh`.\n\nLayout, relative to my home:\n\n- `Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist` — loaded with\n  `launchctl bootstrap gui/$UID ...` on 2026-10-12\n- `bin/nightly-review.zsh` — the job\n- `bin/notify.sh` — Telegram notifier (works when run by hand)\n- `Library/Logs/` — where the plist points stdout/stderr\n- `launchctl-print.txt` — output of `launchctl print gui/501/com.vk.nightly-review`, captu